M/s. R Ltd. is engaged in providing service of transportation of passengers, furnished the following information in the month of April 2025. Find the GST liability.

(1) Service of transportation of passengers by National Waterways: ₹50 lakhs;

(2) Service of transportation of passengers by Stage carriage (non-A/c): ₹5 lakhs;

(3) Service of transportation of passengers by contract carriage for tourism: ₹120 lakhs (bills inclusive of accommodation and transportation etc. indicated as narration at the bottom of invoice.).

(4) Transportation of passenger from Mumbai to Chennai port in a vessel and such service is not for tourism purpose: ₹12 lakhs;

Note: R Ltd. is willing to avail exemption benefits if any. Taxable supplies of Mr. R in the previous year were ₹22 lakh. M/s R Ltd. not opted composition scheme. All supplies are inter-State supplies. Applicable rate of IGST @5% for taxable supplies.
